    "sub_ename": "APPLIED PROGRAMMING DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "\"應用程式設計是一門基礎學科。其目的在於：(一)養成運算思維及建立程式邏輯的基本概念；(二)熟悉Google Colab 開發環境與Visio 流程繪製工具 (三)學習Python程式語言，建立Python 程式設計的基礎能力 (四)能建構簡單應用系統\"",
    "describe_eh": "Applied Program Design is an elementary course. The purpose of this course is fourfold: (1) To become familiar with the procedure of developing a Windows application program or a console application program; (2) to establish the basic concepts of programming logic; (3) to learn VB.NET programming language, and to become familiar with Visual Studio.NET Integrated Development Environment (IDE); and (4) to be able to construct simple application systems.",
